00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:56,360
So what is the principle component analysis?

77
00:06:56,360 --> 00:07:00,480
Analysis is the fact that if you have a data

78
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:02,639
with a lot of dimensions,

79
00:07:02,639 --> 00:07:05,680
you might want to reduce the number of dimensions.

80
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:10,680
So usually when you see the PCA explain what you will have

81
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:19,360
explain what you will have is, for instance, a bunch of 3D points scattered in a plot and you ask

82
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:26,160
the system, give me the line through all those points that represent the biggest variations.

83
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:32,759
So that's really what the principle component means is find the component that has the biggest

84
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:39,800
variations that represent the best the values. So you get one line through all your points.

85
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:45,800
And then you can ask for a second component that will be orthogonal to the first one and

86
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:53,639
that represent the second most important directions for all your data.

87
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:59,000
And you can remap your data inside of those two vectors inside of being in 3D.

88
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:04,800
So in statistics, for instance, you might have a population where you would ask for

89
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:11,600
the weights, the size, the age, the sleeping habits, what they eat, all that kind of stuff.

90
00:08:12,319 --> 00:08:22,960
And you might do a PCA to reduce the number of features to a lower number so you could see if

91
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:30,639
there is a correlation between a bunch of values and if you start to get clusters of populations

92
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:36,399
in some places it will mean that a bunch of your values are actually related and that kind of stuff.

93
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:44,000
In our case we will actually do the same thing. What we have is 220 different heads

94
00:08:45,199 --> 00:08:53,360
and so it will be considered as 220 features and what we want to say is that I want to reduce

